      "title": "Preclinical Study: Effects on Amyloid-beta Precursor Protein Processing in Alzheimer's Disease Models (2014)",
      "description": "This study compared the effects of HLJDT and its individual herbs on amyloid-beta processing in cell models of Alzheimer's disease. A modified formulation without Huang Qin (Radix Scutellariae) was found to more effectively reduce amyloid-beta generation, as baicalein from Huang Qin paradoxically increased amyloid-beta load.",
      "url": "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/24667842/",
      "periodical": "Durairajan SSK, Huang YY, Yuen PY, et al. PLoS ONE, 2014, 9(3):e92954."
    },
    {
      "id": 396,
      "formula_id": 177,
      "title": "Review Article: Huang-Lian Jie-Du Decoction: Phytochemical, Pharmacological and Pharmacokinetic Investigations (2019)",
      "description": "A comprehensive review covering the chemical composition, pharmacological actions, and pharmacokinetic properties of HLJDD. The review documented the formula's broad pharmacological profile including anti-inflammatory, antioxidant, anti-tumour, hypoglycemic, hypolipidemic, neuroprotective, and antimicrobial activities, with key active compounds including berberine, baicalin, and geniposide.",
      "url": "",
      "periodical": "Zheng YF, Dai DZ, et al. Chinese Medicine, 2019, 14:57."
    }
  ],
